worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_10_fa_scratch_resume_claude/fa_scratch_resume_worklog.md:71:- **Scope (must travel with the claim):** (i) budget-scoped — beyond ~50k vanilla's EDT/C50 overtake FA (vanilla EDT reaches 36.43@57.5k; FA never goes below 38.75), so this is a **convergence-speed** result, not an asymptotic one; (ii) per-STEP, not per-compute — FA costs ≈3.5× per step, and exp_10's A2 matched-COMPUTE readout has vanilla ahead; (iii) one training seed per arm; (iv) grid selection on single eval seed, the two picks 5-seed confirmed.
worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_10_fa_scratch_resume_claude/fa_scratch_resume_worklog.md:72:- **Aggregation caveat found and fixed before reporting:** the first pass globbed every JSON per arm and silently mixed in K=1/multi-seed files (it produced a wrong "vanilla best EDT 41.43@37.5k" against a known 40.62@40k). Rebuilt with the step parsed from the eval-name plus an explicit K=8/seed-42 allowlist; provenance spot-checked.
